{
 "translation": "This was being said in front of me, about my brother. If I too were as powerful as Emperor Akbar, I would have had this dishonest girl walled up alive like Anarkali. These artful girls make foolish boys cry tears of blood and laugh the laughter of death, and then quickly become someone else's. I knew very well that Zameer is and will remain an owl. What is Sir's third-class preference? That girl who has no sense to speak of, who has no passion for the progress of the nation, no spirit of sacrifice, no love for the country. Who, even after doing a B.A., neither understood the true nature of a man nor was acquainted with the feelings of a woman. But why do you approve of her so much? You play with others, let's see who can stop you.",
